    "answer": {
      "short": "Tom’s slope: $\\dfrac{12}{6}=2>\\dfrac{23}{12}$.",
      "worked": "Tom:\n$$\\begin{align*}m&=\\frac{12}{6}\\\\m&=2\\end{align*}$$\nJonathan:\n$$\\begin{align*}m&=\\frac{23}{12}\\\\m&<2\\end{align*}$$\nTom’s slope is steeper because it has the greater gradient.",
